cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this method documentation or these test vectors, cite this release and credit Bodytype.org with a link to https://bodytype.org."
title: "Bodytype algorithm v2: method, thresholds and test vectors"
abstract: >-
  Deterministic method documentation and 15 synthetic test vectors for
  Bodytype's v2 four-girth body type styling rules. The release records the
  four inputs, three ratios, five ordered rules, threshold constants, equality
  semantics and single-field stability radii. It is not a trained model, not a
  population sample, not an accuracy study and not medical data. Documentation
  and code are released under the MIT License; synthetic data, tables and
  figures are released under CC BY 4.0. Any use must credit Bodytype.org and
  link to https://bodytype.org.
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "Bodytype.org"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-17"
license: "CC-BY-4.0"
url: "https://bodytype.org/research/bodytype-algorithm-v2"
repository-code: "https://github.com/TSjianjiao/bodytype-research"
keywords:
  - body type calculator
  - algorithm documentation
  - test vectors
  - classification thresholds
  - synthetic data
  - reproducibility
